{"duration": 26.773, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A determined doctor gulped a cup of living bacteria.", "start": 0.05, "end": 2.138}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Colleagues scoffed, saying no germ could survive the stomach\u2019s acid.", "start": 2.338, "end": 5.15}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Marshall drinks the broth in 1984.", "start": 5.35, "end": 7.417}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Three days later nausea and terrible breath appear.", "start": 7.497, "end": 9.64}, {"beat": 2, "text": "By day eight his stomach vomits without acid.", "start": 9.72, "end": 11.69}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it feels like swallowing a spoonful of fire and waiting for the burn.", "start": 11.89, "end": 15.035}, {"beat": 4, "text": "The real reason: H.\u202fpylori\u2019s urease neutralizes stomach acid, letting it colonise and cause acute gastritis.", "start": 15.235, "end": 20.81}, {"beat": 5, "text": "His self\u2011infection proved Koch\u2019s postulates and forced medicine to admit ulcers are infections, not just stress.", "start": 21.01, "end": 25.873}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.09, "end": 0.115, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "determined", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.44, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "doctor", "start": 0.49, "end": 0.79, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "gulped", "start": 0.84, "end": 0.99, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "a", "start": 1.015, "end": 1.04, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "cup", "start": 1.065, "end": 1.165, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "of", "start": 1.19, "end": 1.24, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "living", "start": 1.29, "end": 1.465, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "bacteria.", "start": 1.49, "end": 2.098, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Colleagues", "start": 2.4, "end": 2.7, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "scoffed,", "start": 2.75, "end": 3.275, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "saying", "start": 3.325, "end": 3.475, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "no", "start": 3.5, "end": 3.6, "line": 1, "beat": 1}, {"w": "germ", "start": 3.65, "end": 3.85, "line": 1,